% Unified macros for KU Leuven engineering course documents
% Version 4.2 - "School Macros v4.2" - Robust & Compact
% 
% Features: 
% - Typography: Bitstream Charter (Serif) + Fira Sans (Header) + Fira Mono (Code)
% - Visuals: "Attached Title" boxes with icons and shadow
% - Data: tabularray + siunitx integration, Engineering Plots
% - Workflow: Speed macros (\mat), IDE-like code blocks
